Contract: `OrderJobs` sorts jobs by ascending priority and preserves the original relative order of jobs with the same priority. The implementation is:

```go
type Job struct {
    ID       string
    Priority int
}

func OrderJobs(jobs []Job) {
    sort.Slice(jobs, func(i, j int) bool {
        return jobs[i].Priority < jobs[j].Priority
    })
}
```

Does this meet the contract? If not, name the bug and give the minimal fix.
